title: Relative Humidity Calculator
date: 2026-01-02
program: humid.bas
screenshot: humid.bmp
description: Anyone who lives in a cold dry climate often looks at a weather forecast and wonders what the relative humidity means. If it is -40C and 90% humidity, is that humid? The program calculates what the relative humidity would be indoors based on the temperature and relative humidity outdoors. Equivalent to if the indoor air was entirely replaced by outside air, and then heated back up. Only accepts temperatures from -50C to 50C.